    followed closely by <span class="mref"><img src="logos/claude.svg" alt="" loading="lazy">Claude Opus&nbsp;5.5 [High]</span>.<br>
    Open-weight models generally trail proprietary models.</p>
  <p class="sec-lede">We evaluate each reconstruction&rsquo;s <span class="k3">appearance</span>,
    <span class="k3">geometry</span> and <span class="k3">motion</span>. Models are ranked by
    an <span class="k3">Overall</span> score that averages five metric families; the
    individual scores help identify where each model succeeds or struggles, which
    <a href="#findings">Discussion</a> lays out column by column.</p>

